  "description": "Hackathon Rules Participants can participate in teams of 2 . Students from all colleges are eligible. Round 1: Submit one previous UI/UX project via Figma or Google Drive. Shortlisted participants will qualify for the 6-hour offline final round . A Problem Statement (PS) preference form will be shared 12 hours before the final round . PS will be assigned after orientation based on preference and availability . Participants must complete and submit their solution within 6 hours . Figma, Sketch, Adobe XD, or any design software may be used. Participants must bring their own laptops . Plagiarism or use of another participant's work will result in disqualification .",
